# Build context filter for node-service.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Never send secrets, data or local build output to the builder.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.tfvars
.oci
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
data
infra
docs
